      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nothing to do for this CL, but I wonder if some how it would make sense to surface these constants and need for another buffer higher up in Graphite. There is a lot of talk about managing bind groups higher in graphite and in that world I feel like we\u0027d want to know about extra buffers like this as well (in some sense same for metal and when it will use set*Bytes calls). Also not sure if we could get some advantage from sharing buffers instead of every command buffer needing to make a single small allocation here.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 449,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 449,
        "endChar": 34
      },
      "revId": "fcaa0d5de2d410ddb84105971f2ff27d0ee28ac9",
