        "id": 19079
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-06T15:09:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we can do in the following up patch. Maybe this story https://b.corp.google.com/issues/259267703 is appropriate for tracking it?\n\nbtw, letting higher level layer manage the uniform buffer is a bit wasteful since it will have to use 2 buffers (one staging buffer and one uniform buffer) since Dawn doesn\u0027t allow mapping uniform buffer directly.",
      "parentUuid": "6e1e4924_667797ea",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 449,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 449,
        "endChar": 34
